# Networking Practice Notes

This document contains beginner networking concepts and basic troubleshooting commands used in real environments.

---

## 1. Key Networking Concepts

### LAN (Local Area Network)
A network within a small area such as home, office, or college.

### WAN (Wide Area Network)
A network that covers a large area, such as the internet.

### IP Address
A unique address assigned to a device on a network.

### DNS (Domain Name System)
DNS converts domain names like google.com into IP addresses.

### DHCP (Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol)
DHCP automatically assigns IP addresses to devices.

